'''Ranchers''' (Japanese: '''ぼくじょうおやこ''' ''Ranch Family''), known as '''Belle & Pa''' prior to [[Pokémon Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl]], are a pair of [[Pokémon Trainer]]s that debuted in the [[Generation IV]] {{pkmn|games}}. They are a combination of a {{tc|Rancher}} and {{tc|Cowgirl}}, usually presented as father and daughter.

They raise a variety of different {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} used in [[Double Battle]]s, usually being farmyard animals like {{p|Ponyta}} and {{p|Rapidash}}.

