==In the manga==
[[File:Belle Adventures.png|thumb|200px|Belle in [[Pokémon Adventures]]]]
===Pokémon Adventures===
Belle & Pa first appeared in ''[[PS354|Knowledge of the Unown I]]'', where they were shown working at the [[Pokémon News Press]], with Pa being the editor-in-chief. Pa took a picture of {{adv|Diamond}}, {{adv|Pearl}}, and {{adv|Platinum}} while trying to photograph a pair of {{p|Unown}} that were hovering over their heads to make a scoop of the discovery of a "previously undiscovered" species, but was dismayed to find out it was far from undiscovered when Platinum listed various details about it.

In ''[[PS355|Knowledge of the Unown II]]'', Belle & Pa printed a comic starring the comedy duo Diamond and Pearl, much to Pearl's annoyance.

Belle & Pa made a cameo in ''[[PS415|Double Trouble with Dialga and Palkia V]]'', having been transported to [[Iron Island]] by the distortions in space and time caused by {{p|Dialga}} and {{p|Palkia}}'s battle at the [[Spear Pillar]].
